{"chunk_id": "cc80dfc05006", "text": "Sita fiercely rejects Ravana\u2019s proposal, declaring that even if the cosmos collapses she will never abandon Rama. After Lakshmana leaves to search for Rama, Ravana reveals his true form and abducts Sita. As he carries her through the sky, the aged vulture king Jatayu\u2014friend of Rama\u2019s father\u2014attacks in a heroic attempt to rescue her. Though he wounds Ravana, the demon cuts off Jatayu\u2019s wings and continues to Lanka while Sita drops ornaments to mark her path. Rama and Lakshmana soon discover the dying Jatayu, who tells them of the abduction before dying. Grief-stricken, Rama performs his funeral rites and begins the southern search for Sita, encountering ominous signs and monstrous beings in the forest.\nRavana abducts Sita; Jatayu heroically fights and dies; Rama learns the truth, performs Jatayu\u2019s rites, and begins searching southward.\nThemes: abduction of Sita, loyalty and sacrifice, deception and disguise, grief and duty, quest begins", "vector": [0.004012364894151688, -0.01619621179997921, 0.006373756565153599, 0.004175794310867786, -0.02777636982500553, 0.02492135390639305, -0.03396668657660484, -0.0038355940487235785, -0.022079680114984512, -0.02174614928662777, 0.018757721409201622, 0.022266456857323647, 0.014408491551876068, 0.0212925486266613, 0.004449288826435804, -0.008438306860625744, 0.03655487671494484, -0.011286651715636253, 0.024854648858308792, -0.019491488113999367, 0.0013399564195424318, -0.01711675524711609, -0.004115758929401636, 0.009465578943490982, -0.019144617021083832, -0.011406722478568554, 0.019611557945609093, -0.035594310611486435, 0.03271261230111122, 0.006050232332199812, -0.01719680242240429, -0.010165991261601448, -0.016849931329488754, -0.008351588621735573, -0.014968822710216045, 0.010379450395703316, 0.005433202255517244, -0.018637651577591896, -0.004479306749999523, -0.014848751947283745, 0.008598401211202145, 0.00825153011828661, -0.023947447538375854, 0.013641